  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_brickle_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>probably low quality, brittle wool (cf. OED s.v. britchel, brickle), particularly because it is shipped here in sarplers and pokes</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
